{"seq":1,"slug":"memory-layout","title":"内存布局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/memory-optimization/memory-layout","wordCount":1294,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"内存布局\">内存布局</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>内存布局决定了数据在内存中的物理排列方式，直接影响 CPU 缓存的利用效率和内存访问的性能。同样的算法，仅仅因为数据布局不同，性能差距可以达到一个数量级。理解内存布局的核心是理解<strong>硬件如何访问数据</strong>——CPU 缓存以 64 字节缓存行为单位工作，内存控制器以突发传输（Burst）模式工作，TLB（Translation Lookaside Buffer）缓存虚拟地址到物理地址的映射。这些硬件特性决定了什么样的数据布局是&quot;友好&quot;的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[数据布局设计] --&gt; B[空间局部性]&#10;    A --&gt; C[时间局部性]&#10;    A --&gt; D[对齐要求]&#10;    B --&gt; E[连续内存访问]&#10;    B --&gt; F[缓存行利用率]&#10;    C --&gt; G[热冷数据分离]&#10;    C --&gt; H[工作集大小]&#10;    D --&gt; I[结构体填充]&#10;    D --&gt; J[SIMD 对齐]&#10;    E --&gt; K{性能影响}&#10;    F --&gt; K&#10;    G --&gt; K&#10;    H --&gt; K\">graph TB\n    A[数据布局设计] --&gt; B[空间局部性]\n    A --&gt; C[时间局部性]\n    A --&gt; D[对齐要求]\n    B --&gt; E[连续内存访问]\n    B --&gt; F[缓存行利用率]\n    C --&gt; G[热冷数据分离]\n    C --&gt; H[工作集大小]\n    D --&gt; I[结构体填充]\n    D --&gt; J[SIMD 对齐]\n    E --&gt; K{性能影响}\n    F --&gt; K\n    G --&gt; K\n    H --&gt; K</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>布局模式</th>\n<th>内存特征</th>\n<th>缓存友好度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>紧凑数组</td>\n<td>连续地址，无间隙</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>批量顺序处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AoS (结构体数组)</td>\n<td>每个元素完整存放</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>单元素随机访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SoA (数组的结构体)</td>\n<td>同类字段连续排列</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>批量字段处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>链表</td>\n<td>指针跳转，随机地址</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>频繁插入/删除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哈希表 (开放寻址)</td>\n<td>连续桶数组</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>高频查找</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哈希表 (链地址)</td>\n<td>桶+链表</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>动态大小，冲突多</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"结构体对齐与填充\">结构体对齐与填充</h2><p>CPU 访问未对齐的数据会产生性能惩罚——在某些架构上甚至会触发硬件异常。编译器会自动在结构体成员之间插入<strong>填充字节</strong>（Padding）以满足对齐要求。每个类型都有自然对齐要求：char 对齐到 1 字节，int 对齐到 4 字节，double 和指针对齐到 8 字节。结构体整体的对齐要求等于其最大成员的对齐要求。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;&#10;#include &lt;stddef.h&gt;&#10;&#10;struct Wasteful {&#10;    char a;       // offset 0, size 1&#10;                  // 7 bytes padding&#10;    double b;     // offset 8, size 8&#10;    char c;       // offset 16, size 1&#10;                  // 3 bytes padding&#10;    int d;        // offset 20, size 4&#10;};               // Total: 24 bytes, 10 bytes wasted (42%)&#10;&#10;struct Compact {&#10;    double b;     // offset 0, size 8&#10;    int d;        // offset 8, size 4&#10;    char a;       // offset 12, size 1&#10;    char c;       // offset 13, size 1&#10;                  // 2 bytes padding&#10;};               // Total: 16 bytes, 2 bytes wasted (12.5%)&#10;&#10;int main() {&#10;    printf(&quot;Wasteful: %zu bytes\\n&quot;, sizeof(struct Wasteful));  // 24&#10;    printf(&quot;Compact:  %zu bytes\\n&quot;, sizeof(struct Compact));   // 16&#10;    printf(&quot;Savings:  %.0f%%\\n&quot;, (1.0 - 16.0/24.0) * 100);   // 33%&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;stdio.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;stddef.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Wasteful {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // offset 0, size 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                  // 7 bytes padding</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     // offset 8, size 8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // offset 16, size 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                  // 3 bytes padding</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // offset 20, size 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">               // Total: 24 bytes, 10 bytes wasted (42%)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Compact {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     // offset 0, size 8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // offset 8, size 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // offset 12, size 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // offset 13, size 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                  // 2 bytes padding</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">               // Total: 16 bytes, 2 bytes wasted (12.5%)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    printf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Wasteful: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%zu</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bytes</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Wasteful));</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 24</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    printf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Compact:  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%zu</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bytes</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Compact));</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // 16</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    printf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Savings:  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%.0f%%\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 16.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // 33%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>成员排序的经验法则：<strong>按对齐要求从大到小排列</strong>。这样可以最小化填充字节，让更多的结构体实例装入同一个缓存行。当结构体数组包含百万级元素时，33% 的空间节省意味着更少的缓存未命中和更低的内存带宽消耗。</p>\n<p>在需要精确控制布局的场景中（如网络协议解析、硬件寄存器映射），可以使用编译器的打包属性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"struct __attribute__((packed)) NetworkHeader {&#10;    uint8_t version;&#10;    uint8_t type;&#10;    uint16_t length;&#10;    uint32_t sequence;&#10;};  // 精确 8 字节，无填充&#10;&#10;struct __attribute__((aligned(64))) CacheAligned {&#10;    int data[16];&#10;};  // 强制 64 字节对齐（缓存行对齐）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> __attribute__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((packed)) NetworkHeader {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint8_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> version;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint8_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> type;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint16_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> length;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sequence;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 精确 8 字节，无填充</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> __attribute__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">aligned</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))) CacheAligned {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 强制 64 字节对齐（缓存行对齐）</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"aos-与-soa-布局选择\">AoS 与 SoA 布局选择</h2><p><strong>AoS</strong>（Array of Structures）和 <strong>SoA</strong>（Structure of Arrays）是两种根本不同的数据组织方式。选择哪种取决于数据的<strong>访问模式</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"#define N 1000000&#10;&#10;// AoS: 每个粒子的所有属性存放在一起&#10;struct Particle_AoS {&#10;    float x, y, z;    // 位置&#10;    float vx, vy, vz; // 速度&#10;    float mass;        // 质量&#10;    int type;          // 类型&#10;};&#10;struct Particle_AoS particles_aos[N];&#10;&#10;// SoA: 同类属性连续存放&#10;struct ParticleSystem_SoA {&#10;    float x[N], y[N], z[N];&#10;    float vx[N], vy[N], vz[N];&#10;    float mass[N];&#10;    int type[N];&#10;};&#10;struct ParticleSystem_SoA particles_soa;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#define</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> N</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// AoS: 每个粒子的所有属性存放在一起</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Particle_AoS {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x, y, z;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vx, vy, vz;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 速度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mass;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 质量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> type;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          // 类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Particle_AoS </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">particles_aos</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[N];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// SoA: 同类属性连续存放</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ParticleSystem_SoA {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[N], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[N], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">z</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[N];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> vx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[N], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">vy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[N], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">vz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[N];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> mass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[N];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[N];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ParticleSystem_SoA particles_soa;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当处理只涉及部分字段时，SoA 的优势明显。例如，仅更新所有粒子的位置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// AoS: 每次缓存行加载 32 字节的 Particle_AoS，但只用了 12 字节 (x,y,z)&#10;// 缓存有效利用率: 12/32 = 37.5%&#10;void update_positions_aos(struct Particle_AoS* p, int n, float dt) {&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) {&#10;        p[i].x += p[i].vx * dt;&#10;        p[i].y += p[i].vy * dt;&#10;        p[i].z += p[i].vz * dt;&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// SoA: 缓存行加载的全是 x 坐标，有效利用率 100%&#10;void update_positions_soa(struct ParticleSystem_SoA* ps, int n, float dt) {&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) ps-&gt;x[i] += ps-&gt;vx[i] * dt;&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) ps-&gt;y[i] += ps-&gt;vy[i] * dt;&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) ps-&gt;z[i] += ps-&gt;vz[i] * dt;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// AoS: 每次缓存行加载 32 字节的 Particle_AoS，但只用了 12 字节 (x,y,z)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 缓存有效利用率: 12/32 = 37.5%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> update_positions_aos</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Particle_AoS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> dt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i].x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i].vx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i].y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i].vy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i].z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i].vz </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// SoA: 缓存行加载的全是 x 坐标，有效利用率 100%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> update_positions_soa</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ParticleSystem_SoA</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> ps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> dt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) ps->x[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ps->vx[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) ps->y[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ps->vy[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) ps->z[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ps->vz[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>SoA 布局还天然适合 SIMD 向量化——每个数组都是连续的同类型数据，可以直接加载到 SIMD 寄存器中并行处理。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph AoS 内存布局&#10;        A[[x,y,z,vx,vy,vz,m,t] [x,y,z,vx,vy,vz,m,t] ...&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph SoA 内存布局&#10;        B[x: [x0, x1, x2, x3, ...]&quot;]&#10;        C[y: [y0, y1, y2, y3, ...]&quot;]&#10;        D[vx: [vx0, vx1, vx2, ...]&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt;|访问 x 字段| E[每 32 字节跳一次]&#10;    B --&gt;|访问 x 字段| F[连续读取,缓存命中]\">graph LR\n    subgraph AoS 内存布局\n        A[[x,y,z,vx,vy,vz,m,t] [x,y,z,vx,vy,vz,m,t] ...\"]\n    end\n    subgraph SoA 内存布局\n        B[x: [x0, x1, x2, x3, ...]\"]\n        C[y: [y0, y1, y2, y3, ...]\"]\n        D[vx: [vx0, vx1, vx2, ...]\"]\n    end\n    A --&gt;|访问 x 字段| E[每 32 字节跳一次]\n    B --&gt;|访问 x 字段| F[连续读取,缓存命中]</pre><p>但 AoS 并非一无是处——当需要访问单个实体的所有属性时（如渲染一个粒子），AoS 的所有数据在同一个缓存行内，而 SoA 需要跨多个数组跳跃读取。混合方案 <strong>AoSoA</strong>（Array of Structures of Arrays）在实践中是一种折中：将 N 个元素分成大小为 K（如 8 或 16，匹配 SIMD 宽度）的小块，块内使用 SoA 布局。</p>\n<h2 id=\"面向数据的设计-dod\">面向数据的设计 (DOD)</h2><p>面向数据的设计（Data-Oriented Design, DOD）是一种以数据的存储和访问模式为中心的系统架构思想，与传统的面向对象设计（OOD）形成对比。DOD 的核心原则是：<strong>先设计数据布局，再组织处理逻辑</strong>。</p>\n<p>在 OOD 中，数据被封装在对象内部，对象之间通过指针或引用相互关联，形成复杂的对象图。这种模式对缓存极不友好——遍历对象图意味着大量的指针追逐（Pointer Chasing），每次跳转都可能触发缓存未命中。</p>\n<p>DOD 的设计原则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"1. 将数据按处理阶段组织，而非按实体类型组织&#10;2. 批量处理同类操作，而非逐个实体处理&#10;3. 消除指针间接访问，使用索引和偏移量&#10;4. 按访问频率分离热数据和冷数据\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>1. 将数据按处理阶段组织，而非按实体类型组织</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 批量处理同类操作，而非逐个实体处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 消除指针间接访问，使用索引和偏移量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. 按访问频率分离热数据和冷数据</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一个典型的例子是游戏引擎的实体组件系统（Entity Component System, ECS）。传统 OOP 做法是每个游戏对象包含所有组件的指针，DOD 做法是将同类组件存放在连续数组中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"struct PositionComponent { float x, y, z; };&#10;struct VelocityComponent { float vx, vy, vz; };&#10;struct HealthComponent { int hp, max_hp; };&#10;&#10;struct World {&#10;    struct PositionComponent positions[MAX_ENTITIES];&#10;    struct VelocityComponent velocities[MAX_ENTITIES];&#10;    struct HealthComponent healths[MAX_ENTITIES];&#10;    uint64_t alive_mask[MAX_ENTITIES / 64];&#10;};&#10;&#10;void update_movement(struct World* w, int count, float dt) {&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; count; i++) {&#10;        w-&gt;positions[i].x += w-&gt;velocities[i].vx * dt;&#10;        w-&gt;positions[i].y += w-&gt;velocities[i].vy * dt;&#10;        w-&gt;positions[i].z += w-&gt;velocities[i].vz * dt;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PositionComponent { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x, y, z; };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> VelocityComponent { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vx, vy, vz; };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HealthComponent { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hp, max_hp; };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> World {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PositionComponent </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">positions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[MAX_ENTITIES];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> VelocityComponent </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">velocities</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[MAX_ENTITIES];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HealthComponent </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">healths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[MAX_ENTITIES];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint64_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> alive_mask</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[MAX_ENTITIES </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> update_movement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> World</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> dt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        w->positions[i].x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w->velocities[i].vx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        w->positions[i].y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w->velocities[i].vy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        w->positions[i].z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w->velocities[i].vz </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>面向对象设计 (OOD)</th>\n<th>面向数据设计 (DOD)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>组织单位</td>\n<td>对象/实体</td>\n<td>数据数组/表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存模式</td>\n<td>堆分配，指针关联</td>\n<td>连续数组，索引关联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存友好度</td>\n<td>低（指针追逐）</td>\n<td>高（顺序访问）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码可读性</td>\n<td>直观，符合心智模型</td>\n<td>需要适应，偏底层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>业务逻辑、UI</td>\n<td>高性能数据处理、游戏引擎</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((内存布局))&#10;    对齐与填充&#10;      自然对齐要求&#10;      成员排序优化&#10;      packed vs aligned&#10;    AoS vs SoA&#10;      访问模式决定选择&#10;      缓存有效利用率&#10;      SIMD 友好性&#10;      AoSoA 混合方案&#10;    面向数据设计&#10;      数据驱动架构&#10;      ECS 模式&#10;      消除指针追逐&#10;    指导原则&#10;      按访问模式布局&#10;      热冷数据分离&#10;      连续胜于随机\">mindmap\n  root((内存布局))\n    对齐与填充\n      自然对齐要求\n      成员排序优化\n      packed vs aligned\n    AoS vs SoA\n      访问模式决定选择\n      缓存有效利用率\n      SIMD 友好性\n      AoSoA 混合方案\n    面向数据设计\n      数据驱动架构\n      ECS 模式\n      消除指针追逐\n    指导原则\n      按访问模式布局\n      热冷数据分离\n      连续胜于随机</pre><ul>\n<li>结构体成员<strong>按对齐要求从大到小排列</strong>可以最小化填充字节，节省 20-40% 的内存</li>\n<li><strong>SoA 布局</strong>在批量处理部分字段时缓存利用率远高于 AoS，且天然适合 SIMD 向量化</li>\n<li><strong>AoS 布局</strong>在单实体完整访问时更优，实际选择取决于主要的访问模式</li>\n<li><strong>面向数据的设计</strong>（DOD）将数据布局置于设计的核心，消除指针追逐，提升批量处理性能</li>\n<li>内存布局优化的本质是<strong>让硬件以它最擅长的方式工作</strong>——连续、对齐、可预测的访问模式</li>\n<li>在百万级数据量的场景下，布局优化通常比算法优化带来更直接的性能提升</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内存布局","id":"内存布局"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"结构体对齐与填充","id":"结构体对齐与填充"},{"level":2,"text":"AoS 与 SoA 布局选择","id":"aos-与-soa-布局选择"},{"level":2,"text":"面向数据的设计 (DOD)","id":"面向数据的设计-dod"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"SIMD 向量化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/cpu-optimization/simd-vectorization"},"next":{"title":"分配策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/memory-optimization/allocation-strategies"}}